From: MrUnforsaken
Date: 2026-05-25
Subject: [PATCH 0009] Fix YOLOv8-pose face detection decode (NCHW + DFL + cell center)

Correct YOLOv8-pose ONNX decode: use NCHW tensor access instead of NHWC, add DFL softmax-over-16-bins decode for all 4 bbox boundaries, use class score at channel 64, switch to cell-center-based bbox formula with stride scaling, and apply sigmoid before threshold comparison.
Fix several dimension sanity checks and process all three output heads (P3/P4/P5).

diff --git a/auth/face/detection/face_detection.cc b/auth/face/detection/face_detection.cc
index c5338f7..6346e8f 100644
